   {
    "claim": "In 048b974e the policy turned the wrong way, or took a tight line on the turn, and drove into a white van at low speed without braking. The review blames the policy, but every failure here is flagged as a possible simulator artifact: the ego ended up far off the recorded path. So this case rests partly on runs the simulator may explain.",
    "settings": [
     "S1"
    ]
   },
   {
    "claim": "In 07981e6a the route said turn right, but the policy kept going at about 11 m/s, drifted left into the parking lane and hit a parked car head-on. Every failure here is the policy's fault.",
